# Render Static Site Redirect Rules
#
# ARCHITECTURE:
# react-snap pre-renders each public route into dist/<route>.html
# Render serves .html files natively with Clean URLs enabled (so dist/terms.html is served at /terms).
#
# DO NOT use flat extensionless files (dist/terms, etc.)
# If they exist, Render serves them as binary/octet-stream causing browser downloads.
#
# DO NOT add manual rewrites for pre-rendered pages like /terms /terms.html 200!
# Render's automatic Clean URLs will handle them natively without falling into SPA loops.
#
# SPA private routes continue to use the /* /index.html 200 catch-all fallback.

/* /index.html 200